ery  quick and snappy whereas you have like  this old  square design like you can barely see  anything on the series three it's  definitely limiting now between the sc  and the series seven it's not that big  of a difference but just having those  super thin bezels  definitely nice now what's awesome about  the larger display on the series seven  is that you actually get a full-size  keyboard where you can tap or you can  swipe to make different text messages  compared to the series 3 where you have  to type everything out letter by letter  just like on the se  so that definitely sucks compared to  having the full sized keyboard  exclusively on the series 7. and overall  the series 7 is more useful because it  has much newer watch faces that look  better than the ones on the older ones  especially if you take a look at the  modular duo where you have two  full-sized complications which you can't  get on any other apple watch and now the  last thing i want to mention before we  get into the buyer's guide portion of  this video is battery life even though  apple rates all of the apple watches at  18 hours of battery life the series 3  actually gets noticeably worse battery  life than the se and the series 7. now  since the sc does not have an always on  display it actually might get better  battery life than the series 7 because  this has to stay on and it is brighter  than it was before and now let's get  into the buyer's guide starting off with  who should be buying these series 3. to  be completely honest i don't think that  anybody should be buying the series 3  because first of all it's only 80  dollars cheaper than the se and it has  so many disadvantages especially the  performance with the s3 chip where you  do in real life notice a lot of  stuttering and choppiness and stuff just  loading slowly compared to the se and  the other apple watches and on top of  that the display is just so much worse  and the speakers the crown just  everything's just not a good experience  and honestly i don't think apple should  be selling it anymore it's just so  outdated now moving on to the se this is  actually a really great choice because  you can set this up if you buy the  cellular model for a kid and they can  use just the apple watch by itself  without having to connect it to an  iphone and it just overall has a nice  feature set almost matching the same  features from the series 5 so it's  definitely a good value for 279 and i  think if you don't really care that much  about having the highest end or best  features you just want a nice and new  fresh apple watch the se is definitely a  great choice and finally we have the  series 7. this is for people who haven't  upgraded for years maybe you still have  the series 3 or maybe the series 4 and  you're finally ready to upgrade this is  a nice upgrade because it has all the  latest features the health features with  the blood oxygen monitoring and  everything else and of course the larger  display with the much slimmer bezels  it's just a nice immersive experience  that lets you use the apple watch to  basically the max and to be completely  honest just the always on display by  itself just makes it feel so much more  useful and premium because the display  is on and it kind of looks like a real  watch where you actually have stuff  there instead of being completely black  and it honestly just looks weird to have  nothing there while the always on  display is there and it looks nice and  it's useful you can read all your text  whatever you have your information and  the time it's just so much better now  finishing off with my own personal  experience with which one you should buy  if you're a new apple watch buyer i'd  say just go straight for the series 7  for 400  because in reality most people keep  their apple watches much longer than  their iphones so we're talking four to  five years with the same apple watch so  for a hundred and twenty dollars more  than the se you're just getting so much  bang for the buck so it's not that much  more money if you're considering 45  years of using it so definitely just buy  this one if you're a new apple watch  buyer so there you guys go hopefully  this video helps you make a decision on  which apple watch to buy and we're  actually gonna have the links to each of  these apple watches including the series  four five and six at a discount with the  sales on amazon down in the description  below so if you enjoyed this video go  ahead and click the circle above to  subscribe for more videos like this one  thanks for watching and we'll see you in  the next video  [Music]

